# Database Connection String
# Works with ANY PostgreSQL provider: Supabase, Neon, Railway, Tembo, AWS, or local Postgres.
# Example Supabase: postgresql://postgres.PROJECT_REF:PASSWORD@aws-0-us-east-1.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
# Example Neon: postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@ep-random.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?ssl=require
# If empty, automatically falls back to local SQLite (sqlite:///./blackboard.db) for instant zero-config dev.
